Description: Geodata for PaoPao Gateway (meta-rules-dat)
 GeoIP/GeoSite databases (geoip.metadb, ASN.mmdb, GeoIP.dat, GeoSite.dat)
 from MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat, installed to /etc/config/clash/.
 Packaged separately so it can be updated or replaced independently.
